#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:111
msgid ""
"E-waste is [considered](https://www.weforum.org/reports/a-new-circular-"
"vision-for-electronics-time-for-a-global-reboot/) the “fastest-growing waste "
"stream in the world”, with 44.7 million metric tons generated in 2016&mdash;"
"equivalent to [4,500 Eiffel Towers](https://www.itu.int/en/ITU-D/Climate-"
"Change/Documents/GEM%202017/Global-E-waste%20Monitor%202017%20.pdf), which, "
"when stacked, is 17 times higher than Mount Everest. In 2018, an estimated "
"50 million metric tons of e-waste was reported, motivating the UN to refer "
"to a “[tsunami of e-waste](https://news.un.org/en/story/2015/05/497772) "
"rolling out over the world”. The numbers continue to rise: in 2021, an "
"estimated [57 million metric tons](https://www.bbc.com/news/science-"
"environment-61350996) of e-waste was generated globally. [Less than 20 "
"percent](https://weee-forum.org/ws_news/international-e-waste-day-2021/) of "
"it is collected and recycled, and although it makes up [only 2%](https://www."
"forbes.com/sites/vianneyvaute/2019/04/23/with-love-from-an-oregon-prison-how-"
"eric-lundgren-is-going-to-help-you-recycle-all-your-electronics/) of trash "
"in landfills, it contributes to almost 70% of the toxic waste found there."
msgstr ""
"Elektronisch afval wordt [beschouwd](https://www.weforum.org/reports/a-new-"
"circular-vision-for-electronics-time-for-a-global-reboot/) als de "
"snelstgroeiende afvalstroom ter wereld, met 44,7 miljoen ton in 2016 &mdash; "
"gelijk aan [4.500 Eiffeltorens](https://www.itu.int/en/ITU-D/Climate-Change/"
"Documents/GEM%202017/Global-E-waste%20Monitor%202017%20.pdf), die, wanneer "
"ze op elkaar gestapeld worden, 17 keer hoger zijn dan de Mount Everest. In "
"2018 werd er naar schatting 50 miljoen ton elektronisch afval gerapporteerd, "
"wat de VN ertoe aanzette te spreken van een \"[tsunami van elektronisch "
"afval](https://news.un.org/en/story/2015/05/497772) die over de hele wereld "
"rolt\". De aantallen blijven stijgen: in 2021 werd er wereldwijd naar "
"schatting [57 miljoen ton](https://www.bbc.com/news/science-"
"environment-61350996) elektronisch afval gegenereerd. [Minder dan 20 procent]"
"(https://weee-forum.org/ws_news/international-e-waste-day-2021/) wordt "
"ingezameld en gerecycled, en hoewel het [slechts 2%](https://www.forbes.com/"
"sites/vianneyvaute/2019/04/23/with-love-from-an-oregon-prison-how-eric-"
"lundgren-is-going-to-help-you-recycle-all-your-electronics/) van het afval "
"op stortplaatsen uitmaakt, is het verantwoordelijk voor bijna 70% van het "
"giftige afval dat daar wordt aangetroffen."

